OL,3,AChrista Pike to be first woman executed
OL,4,Ain Tennessee in 200 years - but her
OL,5,Adefence say she's a victim too
OL,6,
OL,7,FSellars finds it hard to reconcile this
OL,8,Fwoman, whom she has only known to be
OL,9,Fkind and protective, with the person
OL,10,Fwho committed a heinous crime 31 years
OL,11,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/41
